CPUMOD   DS    CL4            CPW MODEL
         SPACE 1
CPSTART  DS    D              TOD CLOCK OF LAST VM/370 IPL.
CPUPTIME DS    F              MINUTES SINCE LAST VM/370 IPL.
         SPACE 1                                                        00095000
CPFLAG   DC    X'00'                                                    00096000
CPSHUT   EQU   X'80'          PACK IT IN.                               00097000
CPNOTRAC EQU   X'40'          SUPPRESS TRACEING                         00098000
         SPACE 1                                                        00099000
LISTNRS  DC    PL2'0'         PEOPLE DIALLED IN.                        00100000
